{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/62086fdc52f6371905ffe559fe9afeb0.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/62086fdc52f6371905ffe559fe9afeb0.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Betrayals, promotions, intrigues\u2026 Shredder? Or love?!</strong><br><br><br><strong>What will <i>you</i> choose along the way?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Parliament of Love</u></i></strong> is a romantic visual novel spiced with sharp satire on bureaucracy and office absurdity.<br>Step into the shoes of a newcomer at the enigmatic <strong>Ministry of Reflections (MoR)</strong> \u2014 a place where endless reports and pointless memos collide with friendship, intrigue, and\u2014unexpectedly\u2014real feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: blend into the team, survive the tangled web of office politics, and choose the one you\u2019d like to walk this story with until the end.<br>Beneath the lighthearted tone lies a deeper story \u2014 about finding your place, taking responsibility, and discovering what it truly means to be close to someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/f27038aee5e22ae4e7a843afb6802096.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/f27038aee5e22ae4e7a843afb6802096.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the piles of paperwork and absurd tasks lies a world full of questions:<br>\ud83d\udcac How do you find yourself in a system where everyone signs everything but nothing ever changes?<br>\ud83d\udcac What\u2019s more important \u2014 sincerity or duty?<br>\ud83d\udcac And can true feelings exist in a paper-made world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be fooled by the humor \u2014 beneath the satire hides a story about growing up, self-discovery, and fragile human connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/bbd86b6cdbd4d4fdadc189305a614970.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/bbd86b6cdbd4d4fdadc189305a614970.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Miss Ulyina</i></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The princess everyone avoids. How can someone so sheltered, unfamiliar with the basics of everyday life, influence the fate of a nation? What secrets does her family hide? <i>And if there\u2019s a princess\u2026 could there also be a dragon?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/58b3c93f3a0147d585b735da72653ce1.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/58b3c93f3a0147d585b735da72653ce1.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=1248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Miss Mirovaya</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The left hand of the Chief Secretary, a domineering and untamable fiery fury capable of putting anyone in their place. <i>But what lies behind the mask of anger and defiance?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/271c741328533c826fe6aa66ba374d86.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/271c741328533c826fe6aa66ba374d86.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=1248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Nadezhda Polonskaya</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman burdened with responsibilities far beyond her years. The people\u2019s welfare or the interests of the state? <i>Heartfelt honesty or the honor of the uniform?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/a2af0624f6f49654f5e0301d36b68473.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/a2af0624f6f49654f5e0301d36b68473.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=1248 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Lyuba Chaikina</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first female cosmonaut who now works within the state apparatus, yet keeps her soul among the stars. Reckless but sincere, warm-hearted and full of energy, she can\u2019t shake the feeling that <i>she\u2019s in the wrong place</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/b41931860e809b5426892f3042247162.avif?t=1768541241\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras_big/b41931860e809b5426892f3042247162.webp?t=1768541241 width=1560 height=1248 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067480/extras/26fdbb825abb4b9264494134f784b4ce.avif?t=1768541241\" da